# "{T}: Add {C}." Bot1 plays Promising Vein and taps it for the {C} that pays for a Sol Ring ({1}); the Vein is tapped and the Ring is on the battlefield.
# The Vein is a Cave land (Land - Cave), still on the battlefield: tapping for mana does not sacrifice it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Promising Vein
Sol Ring
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Promising Vein.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Promising Vein.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add)
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Promising Vein; Sol Ring
Bot1.Battlefield.Promising Vein.Tapped = true
